  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Baby Bitch** (1 other source): Baby Bitch closes with a heavy metal ending [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Georgia on my Mind**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2000-09-06** (recommended): source not stated; 36 songs; 179 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Small sold-out club; band's only earlier Paris show was opening for NoMeansNo in 1990. They rated it among their year's best gigs [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2000-09-06**: taped by Pepper using Peter Wroblewski's taping gear; transferred by JKeats; source: Schoeps MK4 > Sony SBM1 > DAP1 [1]",
